   "reason": "The ledger was swept under a written rule on 28 Sep 2026 (sellers of chips, cloud, data-centre capacity and power, and their AI customers, from 1 Jan 2024), adding 41 deals and correcting Amazon's Nov 2024 row to its new $4B. Over the last three quarter ends the trailing-year flow rises from $781B (Dec 2025) to $979B (Mar 2026) to $1,179B (Jun 2026), every step well beyond the $20B dead band, so the rule reads concentrating. The earlier unclear reading compared an unsearched year with a searched one.",
